From: Wall-AF <Allan.F.Wall@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 16:22:01 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] 09972: Add 'Pascal Calling Convention' and auto-pointer
 sizing to support 16-/32-bit

Add 'Pascal Calling Convention' and auto-pointer sizing to support 16-/32-bit pointers based upon calling convention.

Add missed files to support the 'Pascal Calling Convention

Add Borland near/far __fastcall calling conventions
---
