 .../src/decompile/cpp/modelrules.cc           |   1 +
 .../program/model/lang/PrototypeModel.java    |   3 +-
 .../x86/data/languages/x86-16.cspec           | 161 ++++++++++++------
 4 files changed, 113 insertions(+), 56 deletions(-)

